    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Luigi a une nuit pour sauver son th\u00e9\u00e2tre. Une nuit pour trouver un singe capable de monter sur les planches et r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer l'estime de son metteur en sc\u00e8ne japonais ; une nuit pour regagner la confiance de son \u00e9quipe et le respect de sa meilleure amie - qui est aussi sa plus proche collaboratrice... et pour d\u00e9montrer \u00e0 la jeune stagiaire de Sciences Po, tellement p\u00e9trie de certitudes, qu'il existe aussi d'autres fa\u00e7ons dans la vie d'appr\u00e9hender les obstacles...",
        "english": "Luigi has one night to save his theater. One night in which to find a monkey capable of treading the boards and recovering the esteem of his Japanese director; one night in which to regain the trust of his team and the respect of his best femaile friend - who is also his closest collaborator... and in which to show the young intern from the elite Sciences Po business school, so convinced by her own ideas, that there are other ways in life of coping with obstacles."
